works not G R>G: {N} comes away with a result to be quietly proud of, and a list of things to fix.
works: It was the right size of step for now, and the next one already looks closer.
fails not G R>G: Out early, and a long afternoon of watching the others carry on.
fails: All week {N} wonders whether it was the wrong call, and the wondering takes a while to fade.

