scene magic: The court's great trial comes once a year, and the best of the realm are matched before the throne. The steward wants names by the week's end.
- W | enter, and prepare exactly as planned, nothing new at the last minute | v: conformity, security | aim: try | foot: mark kept your word | chance: 55
- U | enter, and study every likely opponent in detail | v: self-direction, achievement | aim: try | foot: mark learned a skill | chance: 50
- B | enter, and let everyone know who has come to win | v: power, achievement | aim: try | foot: person rival | chance: 40
- R | enter, and go all out from the very first minute | v: stimulation, hedonism | aim: try | foot: mark took a wild risk | chance: 40
- G | let this one go by, and keep the year's rhythm steady | v: security, tradition | aim: skip | foot: lesson not every year is the year | chance: 92
- W>B | enter under the club's name, and carry its hopes with your own | v: conformity, power | aim: try | foot: person friend | chance: 52
- B>G | enter, and bring the family to watch so it is theirs too | v: achievement, benevolence | aim: try | foot: means ties+.04 | chance: 50
- G>U | skip it, and use the weeks to rebuild the basics properly | v: tradition, self-direction | aim: skip | foot: door learned a skill | chance: 85
- U>R | enter, with one bold new idea kept back for the day | v: self-direction, stimulation | aim: try | foot: lesson surprise works once | chance: 45
- R>W | go because the others are going and need a full side | v: stimulation, conformity | aim: try | foot: means time-.04 | chance: 52
works not G G>U: Win or lose, {N} holds their own among the best, and some of them notice.
works: The choice was the right one, and the season goes on with something settled.
fails not G G>U: The best are better on the day, and {N} comes home with a long list and a quiet journey.
fails: Watching the results come in from far away, {N} cannot quite shake the feeling of a missed turn.

