works: The gap closes a little, and {rival} notices.
works: Whatever happens next month, {N} knows {Ns} rival better than ever, and fears it less.
fails: {rival} wins again, and seems hardly to notice {N} at all.
fails: The rivalry gets into {Ns} head, and the next weeks go worse for it.

