scene tribal: For a whole year {N} has worked at {aim.doing}, and is no further on than last summer. The clan asks at the new moon who will stand again.
scene magic: For a whole year {N} has drilled at {aim.doing}, and the court's ranking has not moved by one place. The new year's rolls close within the month.
