- B>R | keep it on your own terms: once a week, no plan, no pressure | v: power, hedonism | aim: ease | foot: means time+.05 | chance: 88
- R>G | move to a looser group where it is just for the love of it | v: stimulation, benevolence | aim: work | foot: place gather.circle | chance: 75
