works: Something gives, a little and late, and {N} is glad of the choice that was made.
works: A month on, the choice sits right, and {N} sleeps better for having made it.
fails: The doubt does not go away with the decision, and {N} keeps turning it over.
fails: Nothing changes quickly, whichever way it went, and the waiting is its own hard work.

